    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14255" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποφῠάς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόφυσις</span>
			, <i>appendage,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἐντέρων,</span> of the
			<i>caeca</i> of birds and fishes, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				507b33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				509a17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>outgrowth,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				7.2.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>branch</i> of a blood-vessel, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Oss.</u>
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				667b17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>one of the spines</i> on the tail of the martichoras, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HA</u>
				501a31
			</span></i>.</div>
